Flutter widget evidence for backlog item 4.

No physical device log was captured in this UI-only slice. The proof uses a
MediaListWidget harness with one failed video and one pending video. The action
buttons keep the existing requeue callbacks but now expose distinct tooltips:
Retry upload for failed media and Queue upload for pending media.

Primary command evidence is captured in ../commands.log:
- RED: flutter test --no-pub test/widgets/media_list_widget_test.dart failed
  because Retry upload and Queue upload tooltips were missing.
- GREEN: the same focused widget test passed after MediaListWidget labeled the
  existing requeue actions by upload state.
- ANALYZE: flutter analyze --no-pub passed.
- VISUAL: flutter test --no-pub --update-goldens logs/verification-runs/20260608-1807-explicit-upload-requeue-actions/explicit_upload_actions_visual_test.dart
